WEBVTT

01:42.640 --> 01:44.160
Be careful, be careful.

01:44.760 --> 01:46.920
Be careful. Slow down, slow down.

01:53.320 --> 01:54.800
Only one person can come with him.

01:54.880 --> 01:56.920
You should go back.
I'll contact you if needed.

02:23.920 --> 02:25.000
It's fine now.

02:33.600 --> 02:36.240
Luckily, I borrowed this prop car
from a screenwriter friend's set.

02:36.320 --> 02:39.320
If you're going to debut as an actress,
you'll win Best Actress.

02:39.400 --> 02:42.280
Thank you, everyone.
The blood props were great.

02:42.360 --> 02:44.080
Everyone, well done.

02:44.160 --> 02:45.600
Here's the red envelope.

02:53.280 --> 02:54.480
You can get off here.

03:01.560 --> 03:03.760
I can play any type of role. Like this.

03:04.280 --> 03:05.200
I can even fight.

03:05.280 --> 03:07.080
OK, got it.
Let's collaborate again next time.

03:07.160 --> 03:08.480
Sure.

03:08.560 --> 03:09.760
- Bye. Take care.
- Bye-bye.

03:09.840 --> 03:12.000
- Let's collaborate again.
- Collaborate again?

03:12.680 --> 03:13.960
Su Chengcheng, I'm warning you.

03:14.040 --> 03:15.600
There won't be a next time.

03:16.720 --> 03:18.040
I was just being polite.

03:18.120 --> 03:19.480
Who wants a next time?

03:20.000 --> 03:21.960
Tang Qi was always asking
about Quan Shengtang.

03:22.560 --> 03:25.480
I had no choice.
I had to kill Quan Shengtang.

03:26.080 --> 03:27.960
Qingli. I'll testify.

03:28.040 --> 03:30.560
Tang Qi just wouldn't
let go of Quan Shengtang,

03:30.640 --> 03:31.840
so we had to resort to this.

03:32.520 --> 03:33.840
Had to resort to this?

03:34.360 --> 03:35.920
This is the worst plan.

03:36.000 --> 03:37.680
Excessive joy brings sorrow?
Death of laughter?

03:38.520 --> 03:40.040
What is this nonsense?

03:40.640 --> 03:44.000
You must've gone crazy
to copy this cheesy screenwriter's plot.

03:44.080 --> 03:46.520
It's not low-tier. It's top-tier.

03:47.040 --> 03:48.880
After Fan Jin passed the imperial exam
in The Scholars,

03:48.960 --> 03:51.840
his mother was so happy,
she died laughing.

03:56.160 --> 03:58.760
Even if it's top-tier,
it still depends on the copier.

04:00.360 --> 04:03.880
Your imitation is so awkward that you may
end up gaining less than you lose.

04:05.760 --> 04:08.520
Yes, yes. We won't dare do it again.

04:10.920 --> 04:12.320
Chengcheng.

04:13.000 --> 04:16.560
My son is super handsome.

04:23.000 --> 04:24.560
But I still prefer being myself.

04:26.120 --> 04:28.000
OK. As you wish.

04:35.200 --> 04:37.520
Luckily, the filter was upgraded in time.

04:38.520 --> 04:41.480
Otherwise, Mom and Dad will certainly
punish you for tricking people like this.

04:45.040 --> 04:47.320
When will your filter be upgraded?

04:47.400 --> 04:48.720
CHENGCHENG

04:51.440 --> 04:53.240
UPGRADING

04:55.440 --> 04:57.360
CHENGCHENG
WHEN WILL YOUR FILTER BE UPGRADED?

04:57.440 --> 04:59.840
Just a little left. I'll be home tonight.

05:01.360 --> 05:05.040
Mom's about to explode. Hurry up.

05:07.760 --> 05:11.040
Got it. Please calm her down.

05:17.240 --> 05:20.560
You said your editor's husband
is a screenwriter, right?

05:21.240 --> 05:22.320
An experienced screenwriter.

05:22.400 --> 05:25.160
He knows people in art, props,
and costumes. Even professional actors.

05:25.240 --> 05:27.120
He's taken care of everything
with a few calls.

05:27.200 --> 05:28.560
Now, it's up to you.

05:31.280 --> 05:32.800
Are we really doing this?

05:33.400 --> 05:35.480
Isn't it too cruel?

05:43.920 --> 05:44.760
ANGRY SISTER

05:49.960 --> 05:52.080
Tang Qi went to my house?

05:53.960 --> 05:56.080
Looks like he never believed me.

05:56.720 --> 05:59.560
Why is Tang Qi so annoying?
Why does he keep fixating on me?

06:01.440 --> 06:02.680
I told you before.

06:02.760 --> 06:06.040
Tang Qi may be blind,
but his brain still works.

06:06.880 --> 06:08.800
So, what should I do now?

06:24.760 --> 06:26.480
The filter has been upgraded?

06:32.320 --> 06:34.320
I'm finally back to being myself.

06:35.080 --> 06:36.520
I need to deal with Tang Qi now.

06:37.920 --> 06:39.640
With Qingli around,
nothing bad will happen.

06:39.720 --> 06:41.640
You should check
if the filter has any new features.

06:41.720 --> 06:42.920
Maybe it can help.

06:47.080 --> 06:50.360
3D PROJECTION, NEW

06:51.400 --> 06:53.160
3D Projection.

06:55.040 --> 06:56.240
3D PROJECTION, NEW

07:20.440 --> 07:22.160
Wow.

07:23.120 --> 07:26.800
You turned into me. This is so cool.

07:28.920 --> 07:30.000
Really?

07:30.080 --> 07:31.400
Yes, hurry up.

07:32.120 --> 07:34.280
See for yourself if it's real.

07:35.800 --> 07:37.440
- I'm really you.
- Yep.

07:42.360 --> 07:46.880
3D CREATION, 3D PROJECTION

07:56.040 --> 07:58.680
If I turn on both 3D Creation
and 3D Projection,

07:58.760 --> 08:00.320
both of us can become someone else.

08:02.560 --> 08:04.480
But the voice…

08:09.920 --> 08:13.520
VOICE CHANGE

08:13.600 --> 08:16.800
COOL, LOLI, DELICATE, CHARMING
HOARSE, BOYISH, DEEP, BUBBLY

08:22.560 --> 08:23.920
We can use a voice changer.

08:24.000 --> 08:26.320
Though it's not as good as your filter,
it's good enough to fool people.

08:31.720 --> 08:34.039
I can delay for one more hour.

08:36.799 --> 08:37.640
Let's start the plan.

08:39.679 --> 08:40.799
You don't think it's cruel anymore?

08:40.880 --> 08:43.360
Tang Qi has come to my house.

08:43.880 --> 08:47.280
If I'm not cruel to him,
he'll be cruel to me.

08:54.000 --> 08:56.040
Chengcheng's been learning
Yongchun with me.

08:56.120 --> 08:57.200
She's very healthy.

08:57.280 --> 08:59.080
She hasn't gotten sick once
after growing up.

08:59.160 --> 09:00.720
Not to mention taking leave.

09:01.520 --> 09:03.360
Dad, Mom. You eat.

09:03.440 --> 09:06.000
I'll go eat with Tang Qi outside
and discuss some things.

09:07.760 --> 09:10.760
The 3D Projection feature is amazing.

09:11.320 --> 09:12.160
It might not be a good thing.

09:13.000 --> 09:15.240
The filter has limits.

09:16.680 --> 09:19.040
Like a projector,
there's a distance limit.

09:19.640 --> 09:21.000
It only works within five meters.

09:21.080 --> 09:23.400
If it's over five meters,
I'll automatically revert.

09:33.240 --> 09:34.400
Mr. Tang.

09:39.040 --> 09:40.400
I was so nervous back then.

09:40.480 --> 09:43.520
I was afraid that one mistake
would cause the filter to malfunction.

09:44.680 --> 09:46.440
The filter is powerful enough.

09:47.040 --> 09:48.520
Nothing comes for free.

09:48.600 --> 09:50.200
You should use it less

09:50.280 --> 09:51.960
to avoid even bigger trouble later.

09:52.040 --> 09:53.600
Tang Qi forced me into this.

09:53.680 --> 09:55.800
If you hadn't messed with him,
would he fixate on you?

09:56.600 --> 09:58.360
What's it to me? I…

10:02.600 --> 10:04.080
I'm starving.

10:05.120 --> 10:07.400
Let's return the prop car and go eat.

10:08.600 --> 10:10.640
- Hop on.
- Let's go.

10:14.080 --> 10:15.800
- Thanks, sis.
- Thanks, sis!

10:27.960 --> 10:30.760
Tang. Go change your clothes.

10:30.840 --> 10:32.120
There's blood on your clothes.

11:14.000 --> 11:16.400
Tang, we're going to the hospital now.

11:16.480 --> 11:18.520
We'll see a psychologist immediately.

11:18.600 --> 11:20.000
Don't avoid treatment.

11:20.080 --> 11:23.120
Mental illness
is just like physical illness.

11:23.200 --> 11:25.800
It should be treated calmly.
I'll contact Doctor Chen now.

11:25.880 --> 11:27.400
Wait. Listen to me.

11:27.920 --> 11:31.160
- Is this blood really Quan Shengtang's?
- What do you mean?

11:31.240 --> 11:34.040
The color of this blood
is different from real blood.

11:47.960 --> 11:50.120
Su Miao was struck by lightning.

11:50.640 --> 11:52.800
Fang Jin's personality vanished.

11:53.760 --> 11:56.160
Quan Shengtang died from laughing.

11:56.880 --> 11:57.760
In half a year,

11:58.280 --> 12:01.280
your chances of encountering
an unnatural death are way too high.

12:03.640 --> 12:06.960
From a probability standpoint,
accidental death is a random event.

12:11.960 --> 12:14.320
According to
the China Insurance Regulatory Commission,

12:15.280 --> 12:17.640
the mortality rate
before the age of 30 is 1.36%.

12:17.720 --> 12:21.000
The probability of three consecutive times
with each death so bizarre is…

12:21.080 --> 12:23.800
0.000000001%.

12:25.000 --> 12:26.240
That's…

12:26.320 --> 12:27.520
That's one in a hundred of millions.

12:30.400 --> 12:32.920
That probability is about the same
as a comet hitting the Earth.

12:33.000 --> 12:34.560
There is still a difference.

12:35.080 --> 12:37.880
The probability
of a comet hitting Earth is 0.000001%.

12:37.960 --> 12:38.880
Really?

12:40.440 --> 12:42.240
- This doesn't matter.
- Yeah.

12:42.320 --> 12:43.600
I need to go to the lab.

12:43.680 --> 12:44.760
Let's go together.

12:58.040 --> 12:58.960
No.

13:02.240 --> 13:03.160
There are no blood cells.

13:04.960 --> 13:06.480
It's just pigment.

13:12.280 --> 13:13.560
It's not blood at all.

13:21.000 --> 13:22.480
It's artificial blood used in filming.

13:26.200 --> 13:28.560
Looks like Quan Shengtang didn't die.
It was all just a scene.

13:33.840 --> 13:35.080
Does Quan Shengtang

13:38.200 --> 13:39.680
really exist in this world?

13:39.760 --> 13:41.200
How could there not be?

13:41.720 --> 13:44.680
Didn't you say Quan Shengtang
is Fang Jin's boyfriend?

13:45.480 --> 13:47.680
Right. Fang Jin.

13:55.000 --> 13:56.160
Hello.

13:56.240 --> 13:58.320
The subscriber you dialed is powered off.

14:01.520 --> 14:03.560
I'll contact someone
from Xinnan Technology.

14:14.040 --> 14:16.160
- Hello, Mr. Gu.
- Hello, Secretary Wang.

14:16.240 --> 14:18.880
I need to speak with Dr. Fang.

14:18.960 --> 14:20.600
Dr. Fang is overseas
for an exchange visit.

14:20.680 --> 14:22.880
She won't be back for another two weeks.
I'll arrange for you when she returns.

14:25.080 --> 14:28.160
She didn't say she'd come back early?

14:28.240 --> 14:29.200
No.

14:29.720 --> 14:30.600
Alright then.

14:31.320 --> 14:32.440
We'll wait for her to come back.

14:34.120 --> 14:35.400
This is really strange.

14:36.160 --> 14:38.160
Fang Jin is Quan Shengtang's girlfriend,

14:38.240 --> 14:41.480
but after Quan Shengtang's death,
Fang Jin didn't react at all.

14:41.560 --> 14:42.880
She clearly knows nothing.

14:45.320 --> 14:48.000
But Su Chengcheng and Quan Shengtang…

14:48.680 --> 14:50.040
Are they the same person?

14:50.960 --> 14:53.760
It's impossible. This is too bizarre.

14:54.440 --> 14:57.360
Didn't you see with your own eyes
Su Chengcheng and Quan Shengtang together?

14:57.440 --> 14:58.880
You even touched them, right?

15:00.160 --> 15:02.080
I am Su Chengcheng. It's true.

15:04.760 --> 15:07.280
I am Quan Shengtang. It's also true.

15:13.360 --> 15:14.720
I don't know

15:16.520 --> 15:18.280
what I should believe now.

15:21.760 --> 15:23.480
Quan Shengtang?

15:27.120 --> 15:28.720
Quan, as in all.

15:28.800 --> 15:30.000
Sheng, as in victory.

15:30.080 --> 15:32.320
- Tang, as in the Tang dynasty. Right?
- Yes.

15:34.760 --> 15:36.240
NO ONE AVAILABLE
CONFIRM

15:36.320 --> 15:38.040
There's no information
on this man in the system.

15:39.000 --> 15:41.120
You'd better confirm his identity.

15:41.200 --> 15:43.320
- Don't get fooled.
- There's no such a man?

15:44.520 --> 15:45.400
No.

15:46.000 --> 15:48.000
The name and ID information don't match.

15:49.000 --> 15:50.000
You've definitely been deceived.

16:07.000 --> 16:09.440
- Officer Zhang, thank you.
- You're welcome.

16:09.520 --> 16:11.600
If someone has been deceived,
we'll certainly help verify it.

16:36.040 --> 16:39.120
TANG QI

16:44.560 --> 16:45.440
Hello?

16:46.480 --> 16:48.480
Quan Shengtang should be
having his funeral today.

16:49.160 --> 16:51.640
Please send me the address.
I want to go pay my respects.

17:00.720 --> 17:01.760
Su Chengcheng?

17:04.920 --> 17:06.440
Quan Shengtang…

17:07.400 --> 17:09.160
He's already been cremated.

17:10.680 --> 17:11.680
So soon?

17:11.760 --> 17:14.240
Yes. That's right.

17:14.319 --> 17:16.440
Quan Shengtang had instructed
before he died

17:16.520 --> 17:18.480
to be cremated immediately
after his death,

17:18.560 --> 17:20.240
and his ashes should be
scattered into the sea.

17:20.839 --> 17:24.400
If you want to pay respects to him,
you can just find a river.

17:24.480 --> 17:26.119
All the waters in the world are connected.

17:41.680 --> 17:43.080
Tang Qi?

17:46.760 --> 17:48.600
Does Quan Shengtang have any siblings?

17:51.000 --> 17:54.280
No, he's an only child.

17:54.880 --> 17:56.520
What about his parents?

17:57.400 --> 17:58.240
He…

17:58.880 --> 18:04.920
His parents died in a car accident
when he was very young.

18:08.400 --> 18:10.080
He grew up in an orphanage?

18:12.400 --> 18:14.440
I'm going to visit the orphanage
where he grew up.

18:15.160 --> 18:17.320
No, there was no orphanage.

18:18.040 --> 18:19.720
He…

18:20.240 --> 18:22.640
He was raised by his grandmother.

18:22.720 --> 18:24.920
What about his grandmother?
Is she dead too?

18:25.600 --> 18:27.520
Quan Shengtang's entire family is gone?

18:29.080 --> 18:30.800
His grandmother…

18:32.040 --> 18:35.760
His grandmother didn't die.
She's still alive.

18:36.400 --> 18:38.760
Send me the address.
I'm going to visit her.

18:47.400 --> 18:51.080
Su Chengcheng, are you crazy?

18:51.160 --> 18:54.040
Why would you say she's still alive?
Why not just say she's dead?

19:24.920 --> 19:30.720
PAY ATTENTION TO FIRE SAFETY
DO NOT IMITATE

19:56.160 --> 19:58.120
Are you Tang?

19:58.880 --> 20:00.480
Chengcheng said you'd come.

20:04.400 --> 20:05.320
Granny, hello.

20:05.840 --> 20:08.600
I'm Tang Qi, Quan Shengtang's friend.

20:09.760 --> 20:10.720
Come in.

20:18.560 --> 20:20.600
Make yourself at home.

20:46.520 --> 20:48.560
Sit down.

20:48.640 --> 20:50.080
- Thanks, Granny.
- Have some tea.

21:01.160 --> 21:02.840
These are not movie props.

21:06.040 --> 21:08.720
Are you good friends with Quan?

21:11.480 --> 21:14.400
You call your grandson Quan?

21:17.000 --> 21:20.440
I've called him that since he was little.
I hope he'll have it all.

21:21.040 --> 21:22.600
But unexpectedly…

21:23.360 --> 21:25.160
It's my fault for giving him this name,

21:25.680 --> 21:29.520
which has put pressure on him
and made him focus

21:29.600 --> 21:31.680
on achieving something.

21:44.400 --> 21:46.640
Quan Shengtang was only 24.

21:49.920 --> 21:52.000
People of your generation
had children early.

21:53.200 --> 21:54.440
So, logically,

21:57.480 --> 21:59.840
you should be in your sixties,

22:01.000 --> 22:02.520
but look at you…

22:04.880 --> 22:07.000
- You look older than that.
- Well, Quan…

22:09.040 --> 22:10.120
Quan

22:10.720 --> 22:13.200
was a late child of his parents.

22:13.840 --> 22:15.800
They had him when they were 40.

22:17.000 --> 22:20.120
I have a hard life, so I look old.

22:24.400 --> 22:25.360
Granny,

22:25.880 --> 22:28.160
Quan Shengtang's death
is directly related to me.

22:29.200 --> 22:30.880
If I hadn't insisted on seeing him,

22:31.920 --> 22:33.240
he wouldn't have been so stressed

22:34.360 --> 22:35.560
and developed
stress-induced cardiomyopathy.

22:35.640 --> 22:37.880
Kid, don't say such foolish things.

22:37.960 --> 22:40.800
It's all fate.
It has nothing to do with you.

22:48.720 --> 22:50.120
You're so kind.

22:51.680 --> 22:53.080
I can't let you down.

22:54.080 --> 22:55.520
From now on,

22:56.080 --> 22:57.760
I'll be responsible

22:58.920 --> 22:59.760
for your care.

23:01.760 --> 23:03.480
I'll come see you often

23:04.360 --> 23:05.440
and take care of you.

23:05.520 --> 23:07.640
I'll come at least once a week.

23:10.640 --> 23:11.760
No need.

23:14.880 --> 23:19.320
Young people like you must be busy.
No need for that.

23:19.960 --> 23:22.480
Is she an actor or…

23:32.040 --> 23:33.040
I'm here.

23:37.520 --> 23:39.160
Ms. Liu, on your way to buy veggies?

23:39.240 --> 23:40.800
- Going to work, kid?
- Yes.

23:44.160 --> 23:46.360
Ma'am. Sorry to bother you.

23:46.440 --> 23:47.400
What's the matter?

23:48.240 --> 23:49.800
You've lived here for many years, right?

23:49.880 --> 23:51.360
I've lived here for over 20 years.

23:53.560 --> 23:56.520
My girlfriend had an argument with me
and hid at her grandma's house.

23:56.600 --> 23:57.440
So, I came here.

23:57.520 --> 23:59.760
But she won't answer my calls,

23:59.840 --> 24:02.560
and I'm not sure
if it's really her grandma's house.

24:03.360 --> 24:05.600
- Which one?
- Building 2, Room 401.

24:06.160 --> 24:07.400
Is it Granny Quan's house?

24:07.480 --> 24:09.120
That's the Su family.

24:09.720 --> 24:12.520
Their oldest granddaughter is very pretty,

24:12.600 --> 24:16.280
but she's picky
and still doesn't have a boyfriend.

24:17.680 --> 24:20.800
The younger granddaughter is average,

24:21.960 --> 24:23.400
and she doesn't have a boyfriend either.

24:26.760 --> 24:27.920
The Su family?

24:28.000 --> 24:29.640
Looks like I made a mistake.

24:29.720 --> 24:35.040
Listen, in this building,
there's no one with the surname Quan.

24:36.520 --> 24:37.600
Thank you, ma'am.

24:37.680 --> 24:40.600
Thank you for your time.
I'll think of another way.

24:40.680 --> 24:42.160
- Go look somewhere else.
- Okay.

24:58.240 --> 25:01.440
You're now at Su Qingli
and Su Chengcheng's grandma's house.

25:02.880 --> 25:04.280
Come on, Tang.

25:05.400 --> 25:06.600
Have some fruit.

25:07.160 --> 25:08.320
Thank you, Granny.

25:31.560 --> 25:34.640
Granny,
there used to be photos here, right?

25:35.880 --> 25:37.080
Did you put them away?

25:37.840 --> 25:39.040
The photos?

25:41.560 --> 25:43.120
They've been put away.

25:43.960 --> 25:45.560
I didn't want it to trigger my sorrow.

25:55.400 --> 25:56.400
Is that so?

26:01.840 --> 26:02.880
Have an orange.

26:05.880 --> 26:07.720
You don't like oranges?

26:16.520 --> 26:17.480
What's wrong?

26:39.360 --> 26:40.400
Suddenly…

26:40.480 --> 26:41.720
Suddenly what?

26:46.120 --> 26:48.160
- I suddenly went blind.
- Blind?

26:51.080 --> 26:54.920
Is it blurry,
or you can't see anything at all?

26:57.760 --> 26:58.880
I can't see anything at all.

26:58.960 --> 27:00.720
Nothing at all?

27:01.320 --> 27:02.360
How did this happen?

27:03.120 --> 27:05.480
Granny, don't be scared.

27:08.240 --> 27:09.560
This is an old problem.

27:09.640 --> 27:11.760
- It's okay.
- Let's go.

27:11.840 --> 27:14.360
I'll take you to see a doctor now.

27:14.440 --> 27:16.520
- Let's go.
- No need, Granny. It's okay.

27:16.600 --> 27:19.080
- Let's go. Slow down.
- It's okay, Granny.

27:22.240 --> 27:23.520
How could this happen?

27:25.520 --> 27:26.720
I'll be fine in a moment.

27:27.440 --> 27:30.840
Come on. Let's go.

27:30.920 --> 27:34.160
Slowly, slowly.

27:34.680 --> 27:36.760
Good. Slow down, slow down.

27:38.880 --> 27:39.880
Slow down.

27:41.680 --> 27:42.920
Right, turn around.

27:43.000 --> 27:44.160
Turn, turn.

27:44.240 --> 27:45.200
Don't rush.

27:46.600 --> 27:47.800
Come on, come on.

28:06.880 --> 28:09.320
Granny, are you alright?

28:09.400 --> 28:11.400
I'm fine. Let's go.

28:11.480 --> 28:14.400
We'll be at the door after the next floor.

28:15.120 --> 28:17.440
Slow down. Be careful.

28:45.160 --> 28:47.040
Your eye pressure is normal.
Your retina is normal.

28:47.720 --> 28:50.320
No corneal abnormalities.

28:51.440 --> 28:53.760
Just like last time
when you suddenly couldn't see colors,

28:54.440 --> 28:57.040
this is triggered
by a psychological issue.

28:57.760 --> 28:59.280
So, he should see a psychologist?

29:00.360 --> 29:01.320
Yes.

29:03.280 --> 29:04.160
Tang,

29:05.680 --> 29:07.520
the cause is psychological.

29:08.080 --> 29:09.920
It's related to your life.

29:10.520 --> 29:13.120
Things like what happened
and who you met before you went blind

29:14.200 --> 29:16.880
could be triggers for the condition.

29:17.720 --> 29:20.360
A friend of mine unexpectedly died
in front of me,

29:22.800 --> 29:24.880
and I could only watch.

29:27.400 --> 29:29.280
It was a huge shock to me.

29:32.480 --> 29:34.520
That's likely the cause of the condition.

29:38.360 --> 29:39.920
I see.

29:51.640 --> 29:52.480
Come on.

29:56.480 --> 29:57.320
This way.

29:58.680 --> 30:00.000
Alright, step up.

30:01.000 --> 30:01.880
Let's go up.

30:03.880 --> 30:05.520
Here, let me open the door for you.

30:13.280 --> 30:14.440
Slowly, slowly.

30:16.200 --> 30:17.560
Alright, wait a moment.

30:20.880 --> 30:21.720
Come on.

30:23.720 --> 30:24.760
Slow down, slow down.

30:25.280 --> 30:26.160
Alright.

30:29.520 --> 30:30.440
Wait a second.

30:32.480 --> 30:33.960
Change your shoes. Come on.

30:34.040 --> 30:36.080
Granny. Be careful.

30:36.760 --> 30:37.960
My slippers are black.

30:41.760 --> 30:44.480
Black? I'll find them.

30:46.440 --> 30:47.440
Found them.

30:47.520 --> 30:49.520
Alright, come on.

30:50.400 --> 30:52.120
Slowly, slowly.

30:53.520 --> 30:54.360
This way.

30:55.680 --> 30:56.640
Slow down.

30:59.280 --> 31:00.120
Slowly.

31:01.560 --> 31:02.480
Wait a second.

31:02.560 --> 31:03.880
Sit on the sofa.

31:03.960 --> 31:05.720
I'll get you some water.

31:10.280 --> 31:12.160
The water's on the dining table.

31:14.120 --> 31:17.520
I'll find it. Where is it?

31:19.280 --> 31:20.360
Found it.

31:29.440 --> 31:31.080
Here, have some water.

31:33.200 --> 31:34.040
Thank you.

31:46.440 --> 31:49.880
Granny, my friend will be here soon.

31:49.960 --> 31:51.680
You must be tired too.

31:51.760 --> 31:53.040
You should go back to rest.

31:53.120 --> 31:54.760
It's alright. I'm not tired.

31:54.840 --> 31:57.720
I'll stay with you.
When he arrives, I'll leave.

32:01.120 --> 32:04.200
Tang, what's wrong with your eyes again?

32:04.800 --> 32:07.640
Did Quan Shengtang's grandma do something
that triggered this?

32:11.960 --> 32:14.680
You must be Quan Shengtang's grandma.

32:15.200 --> 32:18.080
Hello. I'm Tang's friend.
My name is Gu Yu.

32:18.160 --> 32:20.040
Thank you for bringing Tang back.

32:21.720 --> 32:24.120
I won't disturb you. I'll leave now.

32:25.160 --> 32:26.040
Granny,

32:26.880 --> 32:28.760
thank you for everything today.

32:28.840 --> 32:32.120
- Gu Yu, please take Granny home.
- No need.

32:32.200 --> 32:36.960
Granny, Quan Shengtang is our friend.

32:37.040 --> 32:38.600
Since he's gone,

32:38.680 --> 32:40.440
we must take care of you.

32:41.160 --> 32:43.760
When you two leave, I'll take a nap.

32:43.840 --> 32:44.960
I'll be fine.

32:46.720 --> 32:48.040
Yes, Granny.

32:48.120 --> 32:49.960
You're old and don't know this area.

32:50.040 --> 32:52.400
We'll be worried if you go back alone.

32:54.000 --> 32:55.280
Thank you, then.

32:55.880 --> 32:57.000
My pleasure.

32:57.080 --> 32:58.400
You rest well.

32:58.480 --> 33:01.040
- Granny.
- Alright.

33:58.000 --> 33:58.920
She's agile.

33:59.680 --> 34:01.360
She doesn't look like an old lady at all.

34:04.320 --> 34:06.000
It was her first time at my place,

34:06.600 --> 34:09.360
but she knew that I'd use
my middle finger to open the door.

34:12.280 --> 34:15.400
And she knew
which pair of shoes were mine.

34:32.760 --> 34:33.840
TANG QI

34:38.560 --> 34:40.080
Granny, why not answer it?

34:40.719 --> 34:43.360
It's an unknown number.
It's probably a sales call.

34:44.199 --> 34:45.400
Then hang it up.

34:46.880 --> 34:49.679
Tang Qi is blind and can't see anything.

34:50.199 --> 34:52.080
Maybe it's urgent.

34:52.840 --> 34:53.880
Granny?

34:55.199 --> 34:56.320
TANG QI

35:03.640 --> 35:06.640
Gu, do you want to call Tang Qi?

35:06.720 --> 35:08.880
He's home alone.
What if something happens?

35:09.520 --> 35:11.880
What could happen to a grown man at home?

35:12.480 --> 35:15.160
Tang can't see.
There's hot water and knives at home.

35:15.240 --> 35:18.440
What if he breaks something,
gets glass shards,

35:18.520 --> 35:21.440
or falls in the bathroom?

35:21.960 --> 35:24.200
You'd better call him and check on him.

35:25.240 --> 35:26.080
Sure.

35:27.480 --> 35:30.480
- Yes?
- Call Tang Qi now.

35:30.560 --> 35:31.600
OK.

35:34.280 --> 35:36.240
Hello. How are you?

35:36.840 --> 35:37.960
I'm fine.

35:38.480 --> 35:41.240
Granny Quan asked me to call
and check on you.

35:42.760 --> 35:44.040
Thank her for her concern.

35:44.560 --> 35:45.920
Alright, bye.

35:48.320 --> 35:50.080
You heard it. He's safe.

35:50.600 --> 35:52.760
That's good.

35:55.640 --> 35:56.480
TANG QI

36:00.360 --> 36:01.200
TANG QI

36:05.040 --> 36:07.280
Why call me if everything's fine?

36:08.040 --> 36:11.120
Could it be
because I healed his eyes last time?

36:11.200 --> 36:12.800
Now he wants my help again?

36:18.040 --> 36:19.120
TANG QI

36:20.600 --> 36:21.440
TANG QI

36:23.240 --> 36:25.440
How persistent this salesperson is.

36:51.880 --> 36:57.560
SOUL DETECTIVE

37:02.080 --> 37:04.440
- Did you have fun today?
- Yes, I did.

37:04.520 --> 37:07.160
It's a pity that Chengcheng
couldn't join us.

37:08.040 --> 37:10.760
- She can join us next time.
- OK.

37:20.800 --> 37:22.320
Chengcheng isn't answering the phone?

37:23.120 --> 37:24.160
She probably didn't hear her phone.

37:24.800 --> 37:26.920
- Let's go upstairs.
- Alright.

37:32.640 --> 37:33.520
Yuan.

37:34.040 --> 37:37.320
Chengcheng said she lent the house
to a friend to film.

37:37.400 --> 37:39.680
- Has the filming finished?
- Yes.

37:41.320 --> 37:42.520
Granny, let's go.

37:57.840 --> 38:00.480
What a coincidence.
What are you doing here?

38:02.080 --> 38:03.880
Yes, what a coincidence.

38:03.960 --> 38:05.720
I'm Yuan's grandma.

38:05.800 --> 38:07.600
You must be Yuan's friend.

38:07.680 --> 38:08.880
Do you live here too?

38:10.040 --> 38:12.600
Hello, Granny. I'm Gu Yu.
I'm a friend of Lin Yuan.

38:13.560 --> 38:16.600
I don't live here. I'm just sending
my friend's grandma home.

38:17.400 --> 38:19.320
Your friend's grandma also lives here?

38:19.400 --> 38:21.000
Which building does she live in?

38:23.480 --> 38:24.320
This building.

38:25.520 --> 38:26.360
This one?

38:31.200 --> 38:32.720
It must be fate
that's brought us together.

38:32.800 --> 38:35.040
These are for you, and this too.

38:35.120 --> 38:37.600
Take it. Yes, take it.

38:38.440 --> 38:40.120
Granny, aren't you hungry?

38:40.200 --> 38:41.120
Let me take you out to eat.

38:41.200 --> 38:42.920
We'll have your favorite,
sauerkraut fish. Let's go.

38:43.000 --> 38:44.400
Invite your friend to join us.

38:44.920 --> 38:47.720
Friend? No, he has to take
his friend's grandma home.

38:47.800 --> 38:49.480
Let's go first.

38:50.480 --> 38:53.160
Alright. I have to go now.
Talk to you later. Goodbye.

38:57.640 --> 38:59.960
As expected of my grandma.

39:10.680 --> 39:12.000
Come on. Come in.

39:16.880 --> 39:18.760
- Come in. Come on.
- Alright.

39:26.600 --> 39:28.520
Granny, you rest. I'll leave now.

39:28.600 --> 39:29.480
What about the toys?

39:30.560 --> 39:31.600
You should keep them.

39:52.400 --> 39:55.480
MISSED CALL: TANG QI

40:21.640 --> 40:22.680
Hello, Mr. Tang.

40:23.200 --> 40:26.840
Sorry. I was at the amusement park,
so I didn't hear my phone.

40:27.880 --> 40:29.200
What do you need from me?

40:30.720 --> 40:31.840
I'm blind.

40:34.800 --> 40:36.200
Have you seen a doctor?

40:37.120 --> 40:38.200
Yes.

40:39.080 --> 40:39.960
It's a psychological issue.

40:40.760 --> 40:42.520
You want me to help?

40:42.600 --> 40:45.000
No problem. Tell me what I should do.

40:45.080 --> 40:46.400
I'll do my best to cooperate.

40:47.800 --> 40:48.880
Why?

40:51.240 --> 40:52.280
What do you mean?

40:53.400 --> 40:55.080
Why are you being so nice to me?

40:56.960 --> 40:58.360
Helping me again and again?

41:02.440 --> 41:05.760
We're alumni
and colleagues at the same company.

41:05.840 --> 41:08.800
How could I not help when I can?

41:10.520 --> 41:11.440
Is that so?

41:13.840 --> 41:15.040
Thank you.

41:15.960 --> 41:16.960
You're welcome.

41:35.560 --> 41:37.960
SOUL DETECTIVE
